{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang='en'>
<head>
  <meta charset='utf-8'>
  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name='description' content='Reach {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}} for bespoke aromatherapy sessions, blends, and retail. Safety-first guidance.'>
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg-1: #0f1724; /* deep indigo */
      --bg-2: #08121a; /* near-black teal */
      --accent: #a78bfa; /* mystic lavender */
      --muted: #94a3b8;
      --card: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      --glass: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), rgba(255,255,255,0.01));
      --radius: 14px;
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;}
    body{
      margin:0;
      background: radial-gradient(1200px 600px at 10% 10%, rgba(167,139,250,0.08), transparent),
                  linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg-1),var(--bg-2));
      color:#e6eef8;
      -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
      -moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;
      background-attachment:fixed;
    }
    /* decorative pattern referenced from assets/img/pattern.svg */
    .page-wrap{
      min-height:100vh;
      display:flex;
      flex-direction:column;
      background-image: url('assets/img/pattern.svg');
      background-repeat:repeat;
      background-size:240px 240px;
      padding:40px 28px;
    }
    header{
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:space-between;
      gap:20px;
      max-width:1100px;
      margin:0 auto 28px auto;
      width:100%;
    }
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}
    .logo{
      width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(167,139,250,0.18), rgba(78,205,196,0.06));
      display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);
      box-shadow:0 6px 22px rgba(2,6,23,0.6), inset 0 -6px 18px rgba(255,255,255,0.01);
    }
    .brand h1{margin:0;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:0.4px}
    nav{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;font-size:14px}
    nav a:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);color:#fff}
    .primary-cta{
      background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#4fd1c5);
      color:#071124;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:12px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;
      box-shadow:0 8px 26px rgba(167,139,250,0.12);
    }
    main{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px;width:100%;align-items:start}

    /* Hero */
    .hero{padding:28px;background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--radius);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);}
    .eyebrow{color:var(--muted);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px}
    .hero h2{margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:28px;line-height:1.05;color:#fff}
    .hero p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);}
    .hero .lead-cta{margin-top:18px;display:flex;gap:12px}

    /* Aside / contact box */
    .aside{position:sticky;top:32px;padding:22px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), rgba(255,255,255,0.01));border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}
    .contact-card h3{margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#fff}
    .meta{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;margin-bottom:10px}
    .pill{display:inline-block;background:rgba(167,139,250,0.14);color:var(--accent);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:600;font-size:13px}

    form{display:grid;gap:12px;margin-top:12px}
    input[type='text'],input[type='email'],input[type='tel'],select,textarea{
      width:100%;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(0,0,0,0.25);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);color:#e6eef8;font-size:14px;
    }
    textarea{min-height:100px;resize:vertical}
    label{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);display:block}
    .row{display:flex;gap:12px}
    .row > *{flex:1}
    .btn-row{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center}
    button{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#4fd1c5);border:none;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;color:#041021;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
    .muted-link{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;text-decoration:none}

    /* info blocks */
    .info-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:18px}
    .info{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.02)}
    .info h4{margin:0 0 6px 0}
    .safety{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:14px}

    footer{max-width:1100px;margin:36px auto 12px auto;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;text-align:center}

    @media (max-width:980px){main{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.aside{position:relative;top:auto}.info-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}
    @media (max-width:560px){.info-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.brand h1{font-size:14px}.hero h2{font-size:22px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class='page-wrap'>
    <header>
      <div class='brand'>
        <div class='logo' aria-hidden='true'>A</div>
        <div>
          <h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>
          <div style='color:var(--muted);font-size:13px'>{{TAGLINE}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label='Main navigation'>
        <a href='index.html'>Home</a>
        <a href='services.html'>Offerings</a>
        <a href='blends.html'>Blends</a>
        <a href='shop.html'>Boutique</a>
        <a href='pricing.html'>Plans</a>
        <a href='about.html'>About</a>
        <a href='book.html'>Book</a>
        <a href='contact.html' class='primary-cta'>Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class='hero' aria-labelledby='contact-hero'>
        <div class='eyebrow'>Reach out</div>
        <h2 id='contact-hero'>Talk with {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}} — gentle, safety-first aromatherapy</h2>
        <p>Whether you have questions about scent profiles, patch-testing, or a custom blend request, send a note. I prioritize clear guidance and safe usage for a mindful experience.</p>
        <div class='lead-cta'>
          <a href='book.html' class='primary-cta'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}' class='muted-link'>Message via email</a>
        </div>

        <div style='margin-top:18px'>
          <h3 style='margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#fff'>Quick contact</h3>
          <p class='safety'>I cannot provide medical diagnoses or promise clinical results. Conversations focus on sensory preferences, safe topical use, dilution, and supportive routines.</p>

          <form id='contact-form' aria-label='Contact form'>
            <div class='row'>
              <div>
                <label for='name'>Full name</label>
                <input id='name' name='name' type='text' placeholder='Your name'>
              </div>
              <div>
                <label for='phone'>Phone</label>
                <input id='phone' name='phone' type='tel' placeholder='{{PHONE}}'>
              </div>
            </div>
            <label for='email'>Email</label>
            <input id='email' name='email' type='email' placeholder='{{EMAIL}}'>

            <label for='reason'>Reason for contact</label>
            <select id='reason' name='reason'>
              <option>General question</option>
              <option>Custom blend request</option>
              <option>Retail order / kits</option>
              <option>Book a consultation</option>
            </select>

            <label for='message'>Message</label>
            <textarea id='message' name='message' placeholder='Tell me about scent preferences, sensitivities, or the support you're looking for.'></textarea>

            <label style='display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center'><input type='checkbox' id='consent' required> <span style='color:var(--muted);font-size:13px'>I understand this is consultative aromatherapy guidance, not medical care.</span></label>

            <div class='btn-row'>
              <button type='submit'>Send message</button>
              <a href='tel:{{PHONE}}' class='muted-link'>Call {{PHONE}}</a>
            </div>
            <div id='form-feedback' style='color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:6px'></div>
          </form>
        </div>

        <div style='margin-top:18px' class='info-grid'>
          <div class='info'>
            <h4>Location</h4>
            <div class='meta'>{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
            <div class='muted-link'>In-person sessions by appointment.</div>
          </div>
          <div class='info'>
            <h4>Hours</h4>
            <div class='meta'>Mon — Fri: 10am — 6pm</div>
            <div class='meta'>Sat: 10am — 2pm | Sun: closed</div>
          </div>
          <div class='info'>
            <h4>Retail &amp; blends</h4>
            <div class='meta'>Kits, roll-ons, and curated blends available in the Boutique.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </section>

      <aside class='aside'>
        <div class='contact-card'>
          <h3>Connect with {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}</h3>
          <div class='meta'>Aromatherapist &amp; scent alchemist — safety-forward practice</div>
          <div style='margin-top:10px'>
            <div class='pill'>By appointment</div>
          </div>

          <div style='margin-top:12px'>
            <div style='font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)'>Phone</div>
            <div style='margin-bottom:10px;font-weight:700'>{{PHONE}}</div>

            <div style='font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)'>Email</div>
            <div style='margin-bottom:10px;font-weight:700'><a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}' style='color:#fff;text-decoration:none'>{{EMAIL}}</a></div>

            <div style='font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)'>Prefered next step</div>
            <div style='margin-top:8px'>
              <a href='book.html' class='primary-cta' style='display:inline-block'>Book a session</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class='safety' style='margin-top:12px'>
            <strong>Safety note:</strong> For pregnancy, young children, pets, or complex health concerns, mention these in your message. I will suggest safe general precautions (dilution, patch testing) and defer to medical providers for clinical advice.
          </div>

        </div>

        <div style='margin-top:14px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)'>
          <div style='margin-bottom:8px'><strong>Quick map</strong></div>
          <div style='width:100%;height:160px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),rgba(255,255,255,0.01));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--muted);border:1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.03)'>Map placeholder — {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <div style='max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding-top:18px'>
        <div style='margin-bottom:8px'>Prefer a quick question? Text or call <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong> or email <strong>{{EMAIL}}</strong>.</div>
        <small>© {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Aromatherapy practice. No medical claims. All guidance is consultative and safety-minded.</small>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script>
    (function(){
      var form=document.getElementById('contact-form');
      var feedback=document.getElementById('form-feedback');
      form.addEventListener('submit',function(e){
        e.preventDefault();
        var name=document.getElementById('name').value || 'there';
        feedback.textContent = 'Thanks ' + name + '! Your message has been noted. We will follow up via email.';
        form.reset();
        setTimeout(function(){feedback.textContent='';},6000);
      });
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"# Chunk 4 — contact.html & README

This bundle provides the contact page for the aromatherapy web experience and a short README with usage notes.

Files included:

- contact.html — The contact/connect page for {{BUSINESS_NAME}}. Contains:
  - Navigation (subtle labels: Home, Offerings, Blends, Boutique, Plans, About, Book, Connect).
  - A hero/contact form with safety-forward language and required consent checkbox.
  - Sticky contact card (phone, email, call-to-action to book).
  - Quick map placeholder and hours.
  - Inline CSS (no external fonts or CDN) and reference to assets/img/pattern.svg for the repeating decorative background.
  - Minimal client-side form handling to simulate submission.

Notes & placeholders to replace:

- Replace the following placeholders in contact.html (and across the site):
  - {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
  - {{TAGLINE}}
  - {{PHONE}}
  - {{EMAIL}}
  - {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
  - {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
  - {{CITY}}
  - {{STATE}}
  - {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}
  - {{FAVORITE_BLEND}}

- Layout family: clinic_modern
- Voice: mystic_modern
- Offer model: retail_addon
- Slug: aromatherapy-2026-02-16T16-15-39-541Z-016
- Seed: 3551683062

Accessibility & safety:
- The copy keeps aromatherapy consultative and avoids medical claims.
- The form includes a consent checkbox acknowledging consultative guidance.
- Add a visible FAQ page (recommended) covering dilution, patch testing, pets, and pregnancy notes. That content belongs on blends.html or a dedicated FAQ section.

Assets:
- The page references assets/img/pattern.svg for the repeating background pattern. Ensure the SVG exists in assets/img/pattern.svg and is unique across the project (per bundle uniqueness requirement).
- No external images, fonts, or CDNs are used.

Styling & visuals:
- Visual richness is achieved with layered gradients, translucent "glass" cards, and the repeating SVG pattern.
- Colors follow a mystic-lavender accent with deep indigo backgrounds suitable for a calming aromatherapy aesthetic.

Integration tips:
- If using a template engine, substitute placeholders at render time.
- Ensure routes for index.html, services.html, blends.html, shop.html, pricing.html, about.html, and book.html exist and match the links used in the nav.
- For production, hook the contact form to your backend or a third-party form handling service; the current script only simulates a client-side success message.

Design notes for other pages (to keep consistency & uniqueness):
- Keep nav labels varied across templates (this file uses 'Boutique' for shop and 'Offerings' for services).
- The blends page should list 8–12 blends with top/middle/base notes, an aroma profile line, and a supporting statement that is safety-focused (e.g., 'supports restful routines' — avoid medical promises).
- Shop should present static product cards (kits, roll-ons, diffusers) with clear ingredient lists and recommended dilution information.

If you need the companion assets (pattern.svg) or the remaining HTML pages for the site, request the next chunk and specify which files you want next."}
BUNDLE_END
